  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan floods 2022 Emergency Food &amp; Shelter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since June 2022, floods in Pakistan have affected over 33 million people and killed over 1,500 people, it is described as the worst flood disaster in country&apos;s history. The victims in this situation are facing various difficulties; most of the people have lost their homes, crops and livestock and are in urgent need for shelter, food, temporary tents. Your donation to Association for Humanitarian Development (AHD) will provide Emergency Support for the Floods 2022 in Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
